 DemoNuGridWin;values;F;colTitles;rowTitles;cellWidths;cellTypes
 F←'F1'
 F ⎕WC'Form' 'NuGrid Demo - Component Embedding'(50 50)(550 650)('Coord' 'Pixel')

⍝ Create sample data: 6 rows × 5 columns
⍝ Columns: Product (Edit), Quantity (Numeric), In Stock (Checkbox), Color (Combo), Price (Label)
 values←6 5⍴⍬
 values[1;]←'Apple' 150 1 'Red' 2.99
 values[2;]←'Banana' 250 1 'Yellow' 1.49
 values[3;]←'Cherry' 50 0 'Red' 5.99
 values[4;]←'Date' 75 1 'Brown' 4.49
 values[5;]←'Elderberry' 30 0 'Purple' 8.99
 values[6;]←'Fig' 100 1 'Brown' 3.49

⍝ Column headers
 colTitles←'Product' 'Quantity' 'In Stock' 'Color' 'Price $'

⍝ Row headers (row numbers 1-6)
 rowTitles←⍕¨⍳6   ⍝ native Grid wants character row titles (NuGrid accepts numeric)

⍝ Column widths: Product=100, Quantity=81, InStock=70, Color=90, Price=70
 cellWidths←100 80 70 90 71

⍝ Create the Grid (native ⎕WC equivalent of EWC's NuGrid)
 (F,'.G')⎕WC'Grid'('Posn'(100 20))('Size'(220 440))('Values' values)('ColTitles' colTitles)('RowTitles' rowTitles)('CellWidths' cellWidths)('TitleWidth' 40)('CurCell'(1 1))('VScroll' ¯1)

⍝ Create Input components (children of the grid) - these are templates for cell types
⍝ 1: Edit for text (Product name)
 (F,'.G.E1')⎕WC'Edit'

⍝ 2: Numeric Edit for numbers (Quantity)
 (F,'.G.E2')⎕WC'Edit'('FieldType' 'Numeric')

⍝ 3: Checkbox for boolean (In Stock)
 (F,'.G.B1')⎕WC'Button'('Style' 'Check')('Caption' '')

⍝ 4: Combo for dropdown (Color)
 (F,'.G.C1')⎕WC'Combo'('Items'('Red' 'Yellow' 'Green' 'Brown' 'Purple' 'Orange'))

⍝ 5: Label for read-only display (Price)
 (F,'.G.L1')⎕WC'Label'

⍝ Set up Input array (component IDs) and CellTypes matrix
⍝ Input: array of component IDs that can be used in cells
 (F,'.G')⎕WS'Input'((F,'.G.E1')(F,'.G.E2')(F,'.G.B1')(F,'.G.C1')(F,'.G.L1'))

⍝ CellTypes: matrix of 1-based indices into Input array
⍝ Each column uses a different component type
 cellTypes←6 5⍴1 2 3 4 5  ⍝ All rows use: Col1=Edit, Col2=Numeric, Col3=Check, Col4=Combo, Col5=Label
 (F,'.G')⎕WS'CellTypes' cellTypes

⍝ Add event handlers
 (F,'.G')⎕WS'Event'(⊂'CellMove' 'CBNuGridWin')
 (F,'.G')⎕WS'Event'(⊂'CellChanged' 'CBNuGridWin')
 (F,'.G')⎕WS'Event'(⊂'KeyPress' 'CBNuGridWin')

⍝ Add instruction labels
 (F,'.Info1')⎕WC'Label' 'Phase 7: Component Embedding Demo'(20 20)(20 600)
 (F,'.Info2')⎕WC'Label' 'Edit text in Product, numbers in Quantity, toggle checkboxes, select from dropdowns'(40 20)(20 600)
 (F,'.Info3')⎕WC'Label' 'Price column is read-only (Label). CellChanged event fires on edits.'(60 20)(20 600)

⍝ Event log section
 (F,'.LogTitle')⎕WC'Label' 'Event Log:'(340 20)(20 100)
 (F,'.Log')⎕WC'Label' '(Events will appear here)'(360 20)(160 600)
